a2a-cpp provides CMake targets:

    find_package(a2a_cpp CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE a2a::client a2a::server a2a::core)

Additional targets are available when needed:

    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE a2a::http a2a::proto_generated)

The PostgreSQL store target is available when the postgres-store feature is enabled:

    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE a2a::store_postgres)

In manifest mode, add the postgres-store feature to vcpkg.json and run vcpkg install without package arguments.

In classic mode, run the install command from a directory that does not contain a vcpkg.json manifest.
